  <button type="button" class="trial-card" data-trial="5" aria-pressed="false"><span class="trial-mark">✹</span><b>VOID ASCENDANT</b><small>Endgame trial · brutal scaling · titan-class elites.</small><em>REWARD ×4.5</em></button>
  <button type="button" class="trial-card" data-trial="6" aria-pressed="false"><span class="trial-mark">♛</span><b>RIFT SOVEREIGN</b><small>Nightmare trial · relentless elite pressure · empowered Titans.</small><em>REWARD ×6.5</em></button>
