</section></details>
<button class="primary" id="startBtn">ENTER THE RIFT →</button><div class="quick-controls"><b>HOW TO SURVIVE</b><span>MOVE · LEFT STICK</span><span>AIM · TAP THE ARENA</span><span>ATTACK · STRIKE</span><span>DODGE · DASH THROUGH WARNING RINGS</span></div><div class="features"><div class="feature"><b>⚔ Weapon Styles</b><span>Four combat identities</span></div><div class="feature"><b>♜ Eight Titan Types</b><span>Distinct attacks and silhouettes</span></div><div class="feature"><b>☄ Rift Mutations</b><span>Changing enemy rules every two waves</span></div></div><details class="settings-fold loadout-fold"><summary><b>BUILD YOUR FIGHTER</b><span>OPTIONAL · WEAPON & DOCTRINE</span></summary><div class="loadout-title">CHOOSE YOUR COMBAT STYLE</div><div class="weapon-grid" id="weaponGrid"><button class="weapon-card selected" type="button" data-weapon="aetherblade" style="--weapon:#72f6ff" aria-pressed="true"><span class="weapon-glyph">⚔</span><span class="weapon-info"><b>Aetherblade</b><small>Balanced · reliable cuts</small><em>POWER 3 · SPEED 3 · REACH 3</em></span></button><button class="weapon-card" type="button" data-weapon="twinfangs" style="--weapon:#ffd27c" aria-pressed="false"><span class="weapon-glyph">⚔</span><span class="weapon-info"><b>Twin Fangs</b><small>Rapid dual strikes · agile</small><em>POWER 2 · SPEED 5 · REACH 2</em></span></button><button class="weapon-card" type="button" data-weapon="duskcleaver" style="--weapon:#ff875f" aria-pressed="false"><span class="weapon-glyph">▰</span><span class="weapon-info"><b>Dusk Cleaver</b><small>Heavy blows · pushes foes</small><em>POWER 5 · SPEED 1 · REACH 4</em></span></button><button class="weapon-card" type="button" data-weapon="riftlance" style="--weapon:#a58bff" aria-pressed="false"><span class="weapon-glyph">➤</span><span class="weapon-info"><b>Rift Lance</b><small>Long, precise thrusts</small><em>POWER 3 · SPEED 3 · REACH 5</em></span></button></div><div class="weapon-summary" id="weaponSummary">SELECTED · AETHERBLADE — balanced blade combat</div>
<div class="doctrine-shell" aria-label="Combat doctrine">
 <div class="doctrine-heading"><b>COMBAT DOCTRINE</b><span>Choose the path that defines your run. You can change it before the next run.</span></div>
 <div class="doctrine-grid" id="doctrineGrid">
  <button type="button" class="doctrine-card selected" data-doctrine="duelist" style="--doctrine:#ff9565" aria-pressed="true"><span class="doctrine-mark">⚔</span><b>CINDER DUELIST</b><small>Precision and pressure. Faster strikes, stronger attacks as your Rift Chain grows.</small><em>CHAIN · OFFENSE</em></button>
  <button type="button" class="doctrine-card" data-doctrine="weaver" style="--doctrine:#c2a0ff" aria-pressed="false"><span class="doctrine-mark">✦</span><b>VOID WEAVER</b><small>Shape the Rift. More special damage, shorter burst cooldown, extra healing on empowered burst.</small><em>RIFT · CONTROL</em></button>
  <button type="button" class="doctrine-card" data-doctrine="warden" style="--doctrine:#72f6ff" aria-pressed="false"><span class="doctrine-mark">⬡</span><b>IRON WARDEN</b><small>Stand through the storm. More starting health, safer dashes, reduced incoming damage.</small><em>GUARD · SURVIVAL</em></button>
 </div>
 <div class="doctrine-summary" id="doctrineSummary" aria-live="polite">SELECTED PATH · CINDER DUELIST</div>
</div></details><div class="echo-intro" id="echoIntro">RIFT ECHO · DASH NEAR MARKED DANGERS OR SKIM PROJECTILES TO CHARGE A COUNTER-BURST. BREAK A TITAN WINDUP WITH A FULLY CHARGED ECHO, THEN DEFEAT IT TO EARN 1 ECLIPSE CORE. PRESS U / CORE TO SPEND 1 CORE AND REMOVE 50% OF A TITAN'S CURRENT HEALTH.</div><div class="campaign-callout" style="width:min(100%,430px);margin:12px auto;padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(114,246,255,.22);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(18,25,48,.58);text-align:left"><b style="color:#72f6ff;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:11px">12-CHAPTER ECLIPSE CAMPAIGN · TITAN PANTHEON</b><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#b9c5e4;margin:6px 0">60 waves · 12 chapter contracts · 3 realms · persistent campaign milestones. Complete each chapter contract by defeating enough enemies and its Titan to earn bonus shards.</p><small id="campaignMenuProgress" style="color:#ffd27c">BEST CAMPAIGN WAVE: 01 · CHAPTERS CLEARED: 0/12</small></div><button class="subbutton" id="worldSelectBtn" style="width:min(100%,360px);margin:0 auto 10px">CHOOSE REALM · ASHEN VERGE</button><div id="worldMenuSummary" class="mini" style="margin:0 0 11px;letter-spacing:.1em">REALM I · BEGIN THE STORY</div><div style="height:9px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="storeMenuBtn" style="width:min(100%,360px)">◈ RIFT BAZAAR · <span id="walletMenu">0</span> SHARDS · <span id="coreMenu">0</span> CORES</button><div style="height:8px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="legacyMenuBtn" style="width:min(100%,360px)">✧ LEGACY & DAILY CONTRACTS · <span id="legacyBadge">0</span></button><div class="mini" id="bestMenu" style="margin-top:15px;letter-spacing:.12em">PERSONAL RECORD: WAVE 01</div><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="settingsMenuBtn" style="width:min(100%,360px)">⚙ GAME SETTINGS</button><div style="height:8px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="audioMenuBtn">SOUND: ON</button><div style="font-size:10px;color:#7f8db3;margin-top:12px">VERSION 2.17.0 · STAGE 34 · SKIRMISHER CHARGE COLLISION</div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="settingsOverlay" style="display:none"><div class="panel settings-panel"><div class="eyebrow">TUNE THE RIFT TO YOUR DEVICE</div><div class="title" id="settingsTitle">GAME <em>SETTINGS</em></div><p class="settings-intro">Choose the visual intensity that fits your device. These options never change combat damage, enemy health, or rewards.</p>
<div class="settings-section"><div class="settings-label"><span>INTERFACE LANGUAGE</span><small>EN / TR / AR</small></div><div class="language-picker settings-language-picker" role="group" aria-label="Language / Dil / اللغة"><button type="button" data-lang="en" aria-pressed="true">EN</button><button type="button" data-lang="tr" aria-pressed="false">TR</button><button type="button" data-lang="ar" aria-pressed="false">عربي</button></div></div>
<div class="settings-section"><div class="settings-label"><span>VISUAL QUALITY</span><small id="qualitySummary">BALANCED</small></div><div class="quality-options" role="group" aria-label="Visual quality"><button type="button" class="quality-btn" data-quality="auto"><b>⚙ Auto</b><small>Adjusts quality to keep gameplay smooth</small></button><button type="button" class="quality-btn" data-quality="low"><b>▱ Saver</b><small>Lowest load for weaker phones</small></button><button type="button" class="quality-btn" data-quality="balanced"><b>◈ Balanced</b><small>Smooth visuals for most devices</small></button><button type="button" class="quality-btn" data-quality="high"><b>✦ Cinematic</b><small>Full particles and stronger glow</small></button></div></div>
<div class="settings-section"><div class="settings-label"><span>SOUND LEVEL</span><small>MASTER VOLUME</small></div><div class="volume-row"><input id="volumeSlider" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="70" aria-label="Master volume"><div id="volumeValue" class="volume-value">70%</div></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:8px"><button type="button" class="switch-btn" id="settingsAudioToggle" aria-pressed="true">SOUND: ON</button></div></div>
<div class="settings-switch"><div><strong>PARTICLE EFFECTS</strong><small>Floating embers, impact sparks and burst trails.</small></div><button type="button" class="switch-btn" id="particlesToggle" aria-pressed="true">ON</button></div>
<div class="settings-switch"><div><strong>SCREEN SHAKE</strong><small>Small camera movement when taking a hit or releasing a Rift Burst.</small></div><button type="button" class="switch-btn" id="shakeToggle" aria-pressed="true">ON</button></div>
<div class="settings-section save-backup-section"><div class="settings-label"><span>SAVE BACKUP</span><small>LOCAL FILE · OFFLINE</small></div><p class="backup-help">Export your progress before changing browsers or clearing app data. Keep the backup file somewhere safe.</p><div class="backup-actions"><button type="button" class="subbutton" id="exportSaveBtn">⇩ EXPORT SAVE</button><button type="button" class="subbutton" id="importSaveBtn">⇧ RESTORE BACKUP</button><input type="file" id="saveImportFile" accept=".json,application/json" hidden></div><p class="backup-notice" id="saveBackupNotice" aria-live="polite">Your save stays on this device unless you export a backup.</p></div><div class="settings-footer"><small>Settings are saved on this device. Low quality can help older phones; Cinematic adds visual effects, not gameplay power.</small><button class="primary" id="closeSettingsBtn" style="min-width:120px;padding:11px 17px;font-size:12px">DONE</button></div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="worldOverlay" style="display:none"><div class="panel realm-panel"><div class="eyebrow">THE SHATTERED WORLD · CAMPAIGN MAP</div><div class="title" id="worldTitle" style="font-size:clamp(27px,5vw,43px)">CHOOSE YOUR <em>REALM</em></div><p class="subtitle">Three regions remain beyond the Rift. Defeat each realm's Titan to unseal the path forward. Your weapon and combat upgrades remain the same system in every realm.</p><div class="realm-grid" id="realmGrid"></div><div class="divider" style="margin:14px 0"></div><div class="realm-footer"><div class="realm-selected-note" id="realmSelectedNote">Choose an unlocked realm to begin your campaign.</div><button class="subbutton" id="closeWorldBtn">BACK TO LOADOUT</button></div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="levelOverlay" style="display:none"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">THE RIFT REWARDS THE STRONG</div><div class="title" id="evolutionTitle" style="font-size:clamp(27px,5vw,43px)">CHOOSE YOUR <em>EVOLUTION</em></div><p class="subtitle">Your essence has awakened. Choose one upgrade.</p><div class="upgrades" id="upgrades"></div><div style="font-size:10px;color:#7f8db3;margin-top:10px">THE WORLD WAITS WHILE YOU CHOOSE</div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="relicOverlay" style="display:none" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="relicTitle"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow" id="relicEyebrow">TITAN CORE RECOVERED</div><div class="title" id="relicTitle" style="font-size:clamp(27px,5vw,43px)">CLAIM A RIFT <em>RELIC</em></div><p class="subtitle" id="relicIntro">The Titan has fallen. Choose one relic to shape the rest of this run.</p><div class="relic-grid" id="relicGrid"></div><div class="relic-rule" id="relicRule">Relics last for this run and cannot be swapped. Every Titan offers a new choice.</div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="pauseOverlay" style="display:none"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">TIME STANDS STILL</div><div class="title" id="pausedTitle">PAU<em>SED</em></div><p class="subtitle">Catch your breath, Riftwalker. The arena is waiting.</p><div class="divider"></div><button class="primary" id="resumeBtn">RESUME FIGHT</button><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="pauseAudioBtn">SOUND: ON</button><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="settingsPauseBtn">⚙ GAME SETTINGS</button><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="storePauseBtn">◈ RIFT BAZAAR</button><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="legacyPauseBtn">✧ LEGACY & CONTRACTS</button><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="restartFromPause">Restart run</button></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="gameOverOverlay" style="display:none"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">THE RIFT CLAIMS ANOTHER</div><div class="title" id="gameOverTitle">RUN <em>ENDED</em></div><p class="subtitle">The Eclipse is not over. Return stronger and rewrite your fate.</p><div class="features run-results"><div class="feature"><b id="finalWave">01</b><span>Highest wave</span></div><div class="feature"><b id="finalKills">0</b><span>Riftborn defeated</span></div><div class="feature"><b id="finalLevel">01</b><span>Peak level</span></div><div class="feature"><b id="finalElites">0</b><span>Elites defeated</span></div></div><div class="mini" id="bestFinal" style="margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:.12em">PERSONAL RECORD: WAVE 01</div><div class="mini" id="trialFinalLabel" style="margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:.08em">TRIAL: STANDARD</div><div class="mini" id="rewardFinalLabel" style="margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:.08em">SHARDS EARNED: 0</div><div class="mini" id="finalRelics" style="margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:.08em">RELICS CLAIMED · 0</div><div class="mini" id="finalCombo" style="margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:.08em">BEST RIFT CHAIN · 0</div><div class="mini" id="finalDoctrine" style="margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:.1em">COMBAT PATH · CINDER DUELIST</div><button class="primary" id="againBtn">RISE AGAIN ↻</button><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="storeOverBtn">◈ VISIT RIFT BAZAAR</button><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="legacyOverBtn">✧ LEGACY & CONTRACTS</button><div style="height:10px"></div><button class="subbutton" id="menuBtn">Return to title</button></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="storeOverlay" style="display:none"><div class="panel store-panel"><div class="eyebrow">TRADE SHARDS · CHANGE YOUR FATE</div><div class="store-heading"><div class="title" id="storeTitle">RIFT <em>BAZAAR</em></div><div class="wallet-pill">◈ <span id="storeBalance">0</span> SHARDS</div></div><p class="store-intro">Permanent upgrades bought here are saved on this device and take effect at the start of your next run. Earn shards by defeating Riftborn and Titans; every purchase is paid once, with rising costs for higher ranks.</p><div class="store-grid" id="storeGrid"></div><div class="revenue-section" id="revenuePanel" aria-label="Optional rewards and supporter cosmetic"></div><div class="store-notice" id="storeNotice" aria-live="polite">Your purchases are saved locally in this browser.</div><div class="store-foot"><small>LOCAL SAVE · OPTIONAL PLAY PURCHASES · OFFLINE FRIENDLY</small><div class="store-buttons"><button class="subbutton" id="storeResetHintBtn">HOW TO EARN SHARDS</button><button class="primary" id="closeStoreBtn" style="min-width:128px;padding:11px 16px;font-size:12px">BACK</button></div></div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="legacyOverlay" style="display:none"><div class="panel legacy-panel"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR HISTORY · YOUR NEXT TRIAL</div><div class="legacy-top"><div class="title">RIFT <em>LEGACY</em></div><div class="legacy-wallet">◈ <span id="legacyWallet">0</span> SHARDS</div></div><p class="subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:none">Your progress lives on this device. Claim earned achievement rewards, complete today's contracts, and unlock sigils that change your character's aura.</p><div class="legacy-summary"><div class="feature"><b id="legacyKills">0</b><span>Lifetime defeats</span></div><div class="feature"><b id="legacyTitans">0</b><span>Titans defeated</span></div><div class="feature"><b id="legacyRuns">0</b><span>Runs started</span></div><div class="feature"><b id="legacyBestWave">01</b><span>Best wave</span></div></div><div class="legacy-section-title">DAILY CONTRACTS · <span id="dailyDateLabel">TODAY</span></div><div class="daily-grid" id="dailyGrid"></div><div class="legacy-section-title">ACHIEVEMENTS · CLAIM ONE-TIME REWARDS</div><div class="legacy-grid" id="achievementGrid"></div><div class="legacy-section-title">RIFT SIGILS · COSMETIC UNLOCKS</div><div class="sigil-grid" id="sigilGrid"></div><div class="legacy-notice" id="legacyNotice" aria-live="polite">Claimed rewards and unlocked sigils are saved locally.</div><div class="legacy-bottom"><small>LOCAL PROFILE · NO ACCOUNT REQUIRED · OFFLINE FRIENDLY</small><button class="primary" id="closeLegacyBtn" style="min-width:120px;padding:11px 17px;font-size:12px">BACK</button></div></div></div>

</div>

<script>
(()=>{'use strict';
// Startup recovery: show a useful message instead of leaving a silent blank canvas.
const showBootRecovery=(reason)=>{
 const box=document.getElementById('runtimeRecovery');if(!box)return;
 const lang=(document.documentElement.lang||'ar').toLowerCase();
 const title=document.getElementById('runtimeRecoveryTitle'),message=document.getElementById('runtimeRecoveryMessage'),button=document.getElementById('bootSafeMode');
 if(title)title.textContent=lang==='tr'?'Oyun başlatılamadı':lang==='en'?'The game could not start':'تعذّر تشغيل اللعبة';
 if(message)message.textContent=lang==='tr'?'Güvenli performans modunu deneyin. Adres content://downloads/ ile başlıyorsa oyun HTML dosyası yerine indirme görüntüleyicisindesiniz. Dosyayı Dosyalarım uygulamasından açın.':lang==='en'?'Try safe performance mode. If the address starts with content://downloads/, you are in the downloads viewer rather than the game HTML. Open the extracted HTML from your Files app.':'يبدو أن اللعبة لم تبدأ. إذا كان العنوان يبدأ بـ content://downloads/ فأنت في عارض التنزيلات، وقد لا يشغّل JavaScript. افتح تطبيق «ملفاتي» ثم «التنزيلات»، استخرج ملف ZIP أولًا، ثم افتح ملف HTML من المجلد المستخرج باستخدام متصفح يدعم صفحات HTML المحلية. لا تحذف بيانات اللعبة.';
 if(button)button.textContent=lang==='tr'?'Güvenli modda yeniden yükle':lang==='en'?'Reload in safe mode':'إعادة التحميل بوضع الأداء الآمن';
 box.hidden=false;box.style.display='flex';
};
window.__EMBERFALL_READY__=false;
window.addEventListener('error',()=>{if(!window.__EMBERFALL_READY__)showBootRecovery('script');},true);
window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',()=>{if(!window.__EMBERFALL_READY__)showBootRecovery('promise');});
const safeModeButton=document.getElementById('bootSafeMode');
if(safeModeButton)safeModeButton.addEventListener('click',()=>{
  try{const key='emberfall_settings_v08';let v={};try{v=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||'{}')||{}}catch(e){};v.quality='low';v.particles=false;v.shake=false;localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}
  // Android content:// download URIs can be temporary grants. Reloading them may
  // make the system report that the file is missing even when the ZIP exists.
  if(location.protocol==='content:'){
    const msg=document.getElementById('runtimeRecoveryMessage');
    if(msg)msg.textContent='تم حفظ إعدادات الأداء الآمن، لكن أندرويد لا يسمح بإعادة فتح رابط التنزيل المؤقت. ارجع إلى تطبيق «ملفاتي» > «التنزيلات»، استخرج ملف ZIP، ثم افتح index.html من المجلد المستخرج باستخدام Chrome. لا تضغط إعادة التحميل من هذه الشاشة.';
    safeModeButton.textContent='تم حفظ الإعدادات — افتح index.html من ملفاتي';
    safeModeButton.disabled=true;
    return;
  }
  safeModeButton.disabled=true;safeModeButton.textContent='جارٍ إعادة التحميل بوضع الأداء الآمن…';
  try{const u=new URL(location.href);u.searchParams.set('emberfallSafe','1');location.href=u.href;}catch(_){try{location.reload()}catch(__){safeModeButton.disabled=false;safeModeButton.textContent='تعذّرت إعادة التحميل — افتح ملف HTML من تطبيق ملفاتي';}}
});
const canvas=document.getElementById('game');
if(!canvas){showBootRecovery('canvas');return;}
const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d',{alpha:false});
if(!ctx){showBootRecovery('canvas2d');return;}
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
const LANGUAGE_KEY='emberfall_language_v1';
const I18N={
 ar:{'VOID ASCENDANT':'صعود العدم','Endgame trial · brutal scaling · titan-class elites.':'تحدي نهاية اللعبة · تصاعد قاسٍ · نخبة بمستوى العمالقة.','PHASE I':'المرحلة الأولى','PHASE II':'المرحلة الثانية','PHASE III':'المرحلة الثالثة','WEAKPOINT OPEN':'نقطة الضعف مكشوفة','ENRAGED':'هائج','FRACTURED':'متصدّع','STAGGERED':'مترنّح','TITAN EXPOSED · STRIKE NOW':'العملاق مكشوف · هاجم الآن','TITAN ASCENSION · PHASE II':'صعود العملاق · المرحلة الثانية','RIFT CATACLYSM · PHASE III':'كارثة الشق · المرحلة الثالثة','TITAN · CROSS-LATTICE · MOVE!':'العملاق · شبكة متقاطعة · تحرّك!','WEAKPOINT ×1.45':'نقطة ضعف ×1.45','LANGUAGE / DİL / اللغة':'اللغة / DİL / LANGUAGE','A NEW REALM IS BREAKING':'عالم جديد على وشك الانهيار','The sky has split. The old light is gone. Read enemy tells, outmaneuver the Riftborn, and survive the Eclipse.':'انشقّت السماء واختفى النور القديم. اقرأ إشارات الأعداء، وراوغ أبناء الشق، واصمد أمام الكسوف.','Weapon Styles':'أنماط الأسلحة','Four combat identities':'أربعة أساليب قتال مختلفة','Five Enemy Types':'خمسة أنواع من الأعداء','Each fights differently':'لكل عدو أسلوبه الخاص','Titan Patterns':'أنماط العمالقة','Warned attacks to dodge':'هجمات تحذيرية يمكن تفاديها','CHOOSE YOUR COMBAT STYLE':'اختر أسلوب القتال','Balanced · reliable cuts':'متوازن · ضربات موثوقة','Rapid dual strikes · agile':'ضربات مزدوجة سريعة · رشاقة','Heavy blows · pushes foes':'ضربات ثقيلة تدفع الأعداء','Long, precise thrusts':'طعنات طويلة ودقيقة','CHOOSE REALM · ASHEN VERGE':'اختر العالم · الأراضي المحترقة','ENTER THE RIFT →':'ادخل الشق ←','RIFT BAZAAR ·':'متجر الشق ·','LEGACY & DAILY CONTRACTS ·':'السجل والعقود اليومية ·','GAME SETTINGS':'إعدادات اللعبة','SOUND: ON':'الصوت: يعمل','SOUND: OFF':'الصوت: متوقف','TUNE THE RIFT TO YOUR DEVICE':'اضبط الشق ليناسب جهازك','GAME SETTINGS':'إعدادات اللعبة','Choose the visual intensity that fits your device. These options never change combat damage, enemy health, or rewards.':'اختر جودة الرسوم المناسبة لجهازك. لا تغيّر هذه الخيارات ضرر القتال أو صحة الأعداء أو المكافآت.','VISUAL QUALITY':'جودة الرسوم','SAVER · LIGHTWEIGHT':'توفير · خفيف','BALANCED · RECOMMENDED':'متوازن · موصى به','CINEMATIC · FULL EFFECTS':'سينمائي · مؤثرات كاملة','Fewer particles and lighter glow':'جزيئات أقل وتوهج أخف','Smooth visuals for most devices':'رسوم سلسة لمعظم الأجهزة','Full particles and stronger glow':'جزيئات كاملة وتوهج أقوى','SOUND LEVEL':'مستوى الصوت','MASTER VOLUME':'الصوت الرئيسي','PARTICLE EFFECTS':'تأثيرات الجزيئات','Floating embers, impact sparks and burst trails.':'جمر متطاير وشرارات اصطدام وآثار الانفجارات.','SCREEN SHAKE':'اهتزاز الشاشة','Small camera movement when taking a hit or releasing a Rift Burst.':'حركة بسيطة للكاميرا عند تلقي ضربة أو إطلاق انفجار الشق.','Settings are saved on this device. Low quality can help older phones; Cinematic adds visual effects, not gameplay power.':'تُحفظ الإعدادات على هذا الجهاز. قد تساعد الجودة المنخفضة الهواتف القديمة؛ أما السينمائية فتضيف مؤثرات بصرية فقط.','DONE':'تم','TIME STANDS STILL':'الزمن متوقف','PAUSED':'متوقف مؤقتًا','Catch your breath, Riftwalker. The arena is waiting.':'التقط أنفاسك أيها العابر. الساحة بانتظارك.','RESUME FIGHT':'تابع القتال','RIFT BAZAAR':'متجر الشق','LEGACY & CONTRACTS':'السجل والعقود','Restart run':'أعد الجولة','THE RIFT CLAIMS ANOTHER':'الشق يبتلع مقاتلًا آخر','RUN ENDED':'انتهت الجولة','The Eclipse is not over. Return stronger and rewrite your fate.':'لم ينتهِ الكسوف. عُد أقوى وأعد كتابة مصيرك.','Highest wave':'أعلى موجة','Riftborn defeated':'الأعداء المهزومون','Peak level':'أعلى مستوى','RISE AGAIN ↻':'انهض مجددًا ↻','VISIT RIFT BAZAAR':'زر متجر الشق','Return to title':'العودة للقائمة الرئيسية','TRADE SHARDS · CHANGE YOUR FATE':'بدّل الشظايا وغيّر مصيرك','Permanent upgrades bought here are saved on this device and take effect at the start of your next run. Earn shards by defeating Riftborn and Titans; every purchase is paid once, with rising costs for higher ranks.':'تُحفظ الترقيات الدائمة على هذا الجهاز وتُفعّل في الجولة التالية. اجمع الشظايا بهزيمة الأعداء والعمالقة؛ ولكل شراء تكلفة تزداد مع الرتب.','Your purchases are saved locally in this browser.':'تُحفظ مشترياتك محليًا في هذا المتصفح.','LOCAL SAVE · OPTIONAL PLAY PURCHASES · OFFLINE FRIENDLY':'حفظ محلي · لا مشتريات بأموال حقيقية · يعمل دون إنترنت','BACK':'رجوع','YOUR HISTORY · YOUR NEXT TRIAL':'سجلك · تحديك القادم','Your progress lives on this device. Claim earned achievement rewards, complete today\'s contracts, and unlock sigils that change your character\'s aura.':'تقدمك محفوظ على هذا الجهاز. استلم مكافآت الإنجازات، وأكمل عقود اليوم، وافتح أختامًا تغيّر هالة شخصيتك.','Lifetime defeats':'إجمالي الأعداء المهزومين','Titans defeated':'العمالقة المهزومون','Runs started':'الجولات التي بدأت','Best wave':'أفضل موجة','DAILY CONTRACTS ·':'العقود اليومية ·','ACHIEVEMENTS · CLAIM ONE-TIME REWARDS':'الإنجازات · مكافآت تُستلم مرة واحدة','RIFT SIGILS · COSMETIC UNLOCKS':'أختام الشق · عناصر تجميلية قابلة للفتح','Claimed rewards and unlocked sigils are saved locally.':'تُحفظ المكافآت المستلمة والأختام المفتوحة محليًا.','LOCAL PROFILE · NO ACCOUNT REQUIRED · OFFLINE FRIENDLY':'ملف محلي · لا حاجة لحساب · يعمل دون إنترنت','CHOOSE YOUR REALM':'اختر عالمك','Three regions remain beyond the Rift. Defeat each realm\'s Titan to unseal the path forward. Your weapon and combat upgrades remain the same system in every realm.':'توجد ثلاثة أقاليم خلف الشق. اهزم عملاق كل إقليم لفتح الطريق التالي. يبقى سلاحك وترقياتك صالحة في جميع العوالم.','Choose an unlocked realm to begin your campaign.':'اختر عالمًا مفتوحًا لبدء رحلتك.','BACK TO LOADOUT':'العودة لاختيار العتاد','CHOOSE YOUR EVOLUTION':'اختر تطورك','Your essence has awakened. Choose one upgrade.':'استيقظ جوهرك. اختر ترقية واحدة.','THE WORLD WAITS WHILE YOU CHOOSE':'العالم ينتظر اختيارك','ELIMINATE THE RIFTBORN':'اقضِ على أبناء الشق','VITAL':'الحيوية','ESSENCE':'الجوهر','WAVE':'الموجة','LEVEL':'المستوى','SHARDS':'الشظايا','MOVE':'تحرك','STRIKE':'اضرب','DASH':'اندفاع','RIFT':'الشق','An original arena survival game':'لعبة بقاء وقتال في ساحة أصلية','Every rift has a price.':'لكل شق ثمن.','PERSONAL RECORD: WAVE':'أفضل سجل: الموجة','OPEN · WAVE 01':'مفتوح · الموجة 01','SOUND ENABLED':'تم تشغيل الصوت','SOUND MUTED':'تم كتم الصوت'},
 tr:{'VOID ASCENDANT':'VOID YÜKSELİŞİ','Endgame trial · brutal scaling · titan-class elites.':'Son oyun sınavı · acımasız ölçekleme · titan sınıfı elitler.','PHASE I':'AŞAMA I','PHASE II':'AŞAMA II','PHASE III':'AŞAMA III','WEAKPOINT OPEN':'ZAYIF NOKTA AÇIK','ENRAGED':'ÖFKELİ','FRACTURED':'ÇATLAK','STAGGERED':'SARSILDI','TITAN EXPOSED · STRIKE NOW':'TİTAN AÇIKTA · ŞİMDİ SALDIR','TITAN ASCENSION · PHASE II':'TİTAN YÜKSELİŞİ · AŞAMA II','RIFT CATACLYSM · PHASE III':'YARIK FELAKETİ · AŞAMA III','TITAN · CROSS-LATTICE · MOVE!':'TİTAN · ÇAPRAZ AĞ · HAREKET ET!','WEAKPOINT ×1.45':'ZAYIF NOKTA ×1.45','LANGUAGE / DİL / اللغة':'DİL / LANGUAGE / اللغة','A NEW REALM IS BREAKING':'YENİ BİR DİYAR ÇÖKÜYOR','The sky has split. The old light is gone. Read enemy tells, outmaneuver the Riftborn, and survive the Eclipse.':'Gökyüzü yarıldı, eski ışık söndü. Düşman işaretlerini oku, Yarıkdoğumluları alt et ve Tutulma’dan sağ çık.','Weapon Styles':'Silah Tarzları','Four combat identities':'Dört farklı savaş tarzı','Five Enemy Types':'Beş Düşman Türü','Each fights differently':'Her biri farklı savaşır','Titan Patterns':'Titan Saldırıları','Warned attacks to dodge':'Önceden bildirilen saldırılar','CHOOSE YOUR COMBAT STYLE':'SAVAŞ TARZINI SEÇ','Balanced · reliable cuts':'Dengeli · güvenilir darbeler','Rapid dual strikes · agile':'Hızlı çift saldırı · çevik','Heavy blows · pushes foes':'Ağır darbeler · düşmanları iter','Long, precise thrusts':'Uzun ve hassas saplamalar','CHOOSE REALM · ASHEN VERGE':'DİYAR SEÇ · KÜL SINIRI','ENTER THE RIFT →':'YARIĞA GİR →','RIFT BAZAAR ·':'YARIK PAZARI ·','LEGACY & DAILY CONTRACTS ·':'MİRAS VE GÜNLÜK GÖREVLER ·','GAME SETTINGS':'OYUN AYARLARI','SOUND: ON':'SES: AÇIK','SOUND: OFF':'SES: KAPALI','TUNE THE RIFT TO YOUR DEVICE':'YARIĞI CİHAZINA GÖRE AYARLA','Choose the visual intensity that fits your device. These options never change combat damage, enemy health, or rewards.':'Cihazına uygun görsel kaliteyi seç. Bu ayarlar hasarı, düşman canını veya ödülleri değiştirmez.','VISUAL QUALITY':'GÖRSEL KALİTE','SAVER · LIGHTWEIGHT':'TASARRUF · HAFİF','BALANCED · RECOMMENDED':'DENGELİ · ÖNERİLEN','CINEMATIC · FULL EFFECTS':'SİNEMATİK · TAM EFEKTLER','Fewer particles and lighter glow':'Daha az parçacık ve hafif parıltı','Smooth visuals for most devices':'Çoğu cihaz için akıcı görüntü','Full particles and stronger glow':'Tam parçacıklar ve güçlü parıltı','SOUND LEVEL':'SES DÜZEYİ','MASTER VOLUME':'ANA SES','PARTICLE EFFECTS':'PARÇACIK EFEKTLERİ','Floating embers, impact sparks and burst trails.':'Uçuşan közler, çarpışma kıvılcımları ve patlama izleri.','SCREEN SHAKE':'EKRAN SARSINTISI','Small camera movement when taking a hit or releasing a Rift Burst.':'Hasar alırken veya Yarık Patlaması kullanırken hafif kamera hareketi.','Settings are saved on this device. Low quality can help older phones; Cinematic adds visual effects, not gameplay power.':'Ayarlar bu cihaza kaydedilir. Düşük kalite eski telefonlara yardımcı olabilir; sinematik mod yalnızca görsel efekt ekler.','DONE':'TAMAM','TIME STANDS STILL':'ZAMAN DURDU','PAUSED':'DURAKLATILDI','Catch your breath, Riftwalker. The arena is waiting.':'Nefeslen Yarık Gezgin’i. Arena seni bekliyor.','RESUME FIGHT':'SAVAŞA DÖN','RIFT BAZAAR':'YARIK PAZARI','LEGACY & CONTRACTS':'MİRAS VE GÖREVLER','Restart run':'Turu yeniden başlat','THE RIFT CLAIMS ANOTHER':'YARIK BİRİNİ DAHA ALDI','RUN ENDED':'TUR BİTTİ','The Eclipse is not over. Return stronger and rewrite your fate.':'Tutulma bitmedi. Daha güçlü dön ve kaderini değiştir.','Highest wave':'En yüksek dalga','Riftborn defeated':'Yenilen Yarıkdoğumlu','Peak level':'En yüksek seviye','RISE AGAIN ↻':'YENİDEN AYAĞA KALK ↻','VISIT RIFT BAZAAR':'YARIK PAZARINI ZİYARET ET','Return to title':'Ana menüye dön','TRADE SHARDS · CHANGE YOUR FATE':'PARÇALARI TAKAS ET · KADERİNİ DEĞİŞTİR','Permanent upgrades bought here are saved on this device and take effect at the start of your next run. Earn shards by defeating Riftborn and Titans; every purchase is paid 