Object.assign(I18N.tr, {"UNSEALED · START AT WAVE 01":"AÇILDI · DALGA 01’DEN BAŞLA","Legacy and Daily Contracts":"Miras ve Günlük Görevler","rewards ready":"ödül alınmaya hazır","SOUND LEVEL":"SES DÜZEYİ","MASTER VOLUME":"ANA SES DÜZEYİ","GAME SETTINGS":"OYUN AYARLARI","Four combat identities":"Dört farklı savaş tarzı","OPEN · WAVE 01":"AÇIK · DALGA 01","ENRAGED":"ÖFKELİ"});
Object.assign(I18N.ar,{'Piercing thrusts strike through a line of foes; later targets take reduced damage.':'طعنات نافذة تخترق صف الأعداء، ويقل الضرر على الأهداف اللاحقة.',"INTERFACE LANGUAGE":"لغة الواجهة","Balanced cuts for every situation.":"ضربات متوازنة تناسب مختلف المواقف.","Fast dual strikes and agile movement.":"ضربات مزدوجة سريعة وحركة رشيقة.","Heavy broad hits that knock back lighter foes.":"ضربات ثقيلة وواسعة تدفع الأعداء الأخف وزنًا.","Long, narrow thrusts reward careful aim.":"طعنات طويلة وضيقة تكافئ التصويب الدقيق.","ASHEN VERGE":"الأطراف الرمادية","THE BROKEN BORDER":"الحدود المحطمة","The Eclipse first split the sky here. Black glass and fallen embers mark the place where the old light died.":"هنا شقّ الكسوف السماء للمرة الأولى. يكسو الزجاج الأسود والجمر المتساقط المكان الذي انطفأ فيه النور القديم.","REALM TRIAL · Survive the first five waves and defeat the Rift Titan.":"اختبار العالم · اصمد في الموجات الخمس الأولى واهزم عملاق الشق.","OBJECTIVE · SURVIVE THE ASHEN VERGE":"الهدف · اصمد في الأطراف الرمادية","ASHEN VERGE · THE ECLIPSE BEGINS":"الأطراف الرمادية · يبدأ الكسوف","RIFT TITAN":"عملاق الشق","GLOAMWOOD":"غابة الشفق","THE LIVING DUSK":"الغسق الحي","A forest swallowed by twilight. Its roots remember every warrior lost beneath the canopy and lash out at anyone who stands still.":"غابة ابتلعها الشفق. تتذكر جذورها كل محارب فُقد تحت أغصانها، وتهاجم كل من يتوقف عن الحركة.","REALM TRIAL · Bramble blooms mark the ground before striking. Keep moving.":"اختبار العالم · تظهر علامات الأشواك على الأرض قبل الهجوم. واصل الحركة.","OBJECTIVE · BREAK THE BRAMBLE CURSE":"الهدف · اكسر لعنة الأشواك","GLOAMWOOD UNSEALED · WATCH THE ROOTS":"فُتحت غابة الشفق · احذر الجذور","THORN TITAN":"عملاق الأشواك","FROSTVEIN CITADEL":"قلعة عروق الصقيع","THE SILENT CROWN":"التاج الصامت","An abandoned citadel locked in a storm without end. The ice records each step, then punishes anyone who cannot escape its falling shards.":"قلعة مهجورة حبيسة عاصفة لا تنتهي. يسجل الجليد كل خطوة، ثم يعاقب من لا ينجو من شظاياه المتساقطة.","REALM TRIAL · Frostfall zones deal heavy damage and slow you briefly.":"اختبار العالم · مناطق الصقيع تسبب ضررًا كبيرًا وتبطئك مؤقتًا.","OBJECTIVE · ENDURE THE FROSTFALL":"الهدف · تحمّل عاصفة الصقيع","FROSTVEIN CITADEL · THE COLD IS HUNTING YOU":"قلعة عروق الصقيع · البرد يطاردك","FROST TITAN":"عملاق الصقيع","Vitality Matrix":"مصفوفة الحيوية","+15 maximum HP per rank. Start each run at full vitality.":"‏+15 إلى الصحة القصوى لكل رتبة. ابدأ كل جولة بصحة كاملة.","Rune of Ruin":"رون الخراب","+8% base weapon damage per rank. Stacks with run upgrades.":"‏+8% إلى ضرر السلاح الأساسي لكل رتبة، وتتراكم مع ترقيات الجولة.","Phase Cell":"خلية الطور","Dash recovers 8% faster per rank, up to four ranks.":"تتعافى القدرة على الاندفاع أسرع بنسبة 8% لكل رتبة، حتى أربع رتب.","Rift Capacitor":"مكثّف الشق","+10% Rift Burst damage per rank.":"‏+10% إلى ضرر انفجار الشق لكل رتبة.","Soul Magnet":"مغناطيس الأرواح","Essence orbs begin pulling toward you from farther away.":"تبدأ كرات الجوهر بالانجذاب إليك من مسافة أبعد.","Choose a permanent upgrade. It will take effect next run.":"اختر ترقية دائمة. ستدخل حيز التنفيذ في الجولة التالية.","This upgrade has reached its maximum rank.":"وصلت هذه الترقية إلى أقصى رتبة.","Not enough shards. Defeat more Riftborn to earn":"الشظايا غير كافية. اهزم المزيد من أبناء الشق لتحصل على","additional shards.":"من الشظايا الإضافية.","Defeat enemies for 5–8 shards each. Titans award 45 shards. Every kill is saved to your local wallet.":"اهزم الأعداء لتحصل على 5–8 شظايا لكل عدو. يمنحك العمالقة 45 شظية. تُحفظ كل مكافأة في رصيدك المحلي.","Browser storage is unavailable; purchases may not persist after closing the page.":"تخزين المتصفح غير متاح؛ قد لا تبقى المشتريات بعد إغلاق الصفحة.","PURCHASE COMPLETE":"اكتمل الشراء","is now rank":"أصبح الآن في الرتبة","Active next run.":"سيُفعّل في الجولة التالية.","Storage is unavailable, so it may not survive closing the page.":"التخزين غير متاح، وقد لا يبقى الشراء بعد إغلاق الصفحة.","MAX RANK":"أقصى رتبة","BUY UPGRADE":"شراء الترقية","NEED":"ينقصك","MORE":"إضافية","RANK":"الرتبة","PERMANENT RANK":"الرتبة الدائمة","DAILY":"يومي","PROGRESS":"التقدم","REWARD CLAIMED":"تم استلام المكافأة","CLAIM":"استلام","IN PROGRESS":"قيد التنفيذ","LOCKED":"مقفل","EQUIPPED":"مجهز","UNLOCKED":"مفتوح","Always available":"متاح دائمًا","Defeat 50 Riftborn":"اهزم 50 من أبناء الشق","Defeat your first Titan":"اهزم أول عملاق","Unseal Gloamwood":"افتح غابة الشفق","Unseal Frostvein Citadel":"افتح قلعة عروق الصقيع","Start a run with all 4 weapons":"ابدأ جولة بكل الأسلحة الأربعة","Rift Spark":"شرارة الشق","Ember Trail":"أثر الجمر","Titanbreaker":"قاهر العمالقة","Gloam Warden":"حارس الشفق","Frost Crown":"تاج الصقيع","Prism Walker":"عابر المنشور","FIRST SPARK":"الشرارة الأولى","Defeat your first Riftborn.":"اهزم أول عدو من أبناء الشق.","INITIATION":"البداية","SOUL HARVESTER":"حاصد الأرواح","Defeat 100 enemies across all runs.":"اهزم 100 عدو عبر جميع الجولات.","HUNTER":"الصياد","TITAN BREAKER":"قاهر العمالقة","Defeat your first realm Titan.":"اهزم أول عملاق للعالم.","BOSS SLAYER":"قاتل الزعماء","TITAN TRIO":"ثلاثية العمالقة","Defeat three Titans in total.":"اهزم ثلاثة عمالقة بالمجموع.","VETERAN":"المخضرم","STORM SURVIVOR":"ناجي العاصفة","Reach wave 10 in your campaign record.":"وصل إلى الموجة العاشرة في سجل حملتك.","SURVIVAL":"البقاء","REALMWALKER":"عابر العوالم","Unseal the second realm.":"افتح العالم الثاني.","EXPLORER":"المستكشف","FROSTBOUND":"أسير الصقيع","Unseal all three realms.":"افتح العوالم الثلاثة كلها.","CAMPAIGN":"الحملة","THE ARSENAL":"ترسانة الأسلحة","Start a run with each of the four weapons.":"ابدأ جولة باستخدام كل واحد من الأسلحة الأربعة.","MASTERY":"الإتقان","RIFTSWEEPER":"منظّف الشقوق","Defeat 25 enemies today.":"اهزم 25 عدوًا اليوم.","DEFEATS":"هزائم","RIFT CONDUIT":"قناة الشق","Cast Rift Burst 5 times today.":"استخدم انفجار الشق خمس مرات اليوم.","CASTS":"استخدامات","TITAN BOUNTY":"مكافأة العملاق","Defeat a Titan today.":"اهزم عملاقًا اليوم.","TITANS":"عمالقة","Razor Covenant":"عهد النصل","Blade damage +25%. Your strikes bite deeper.":"‏+25% إلى ضرر النصل. تصبح ضرباتك أشد فتكًا.","Ghoststep":"خطوة الشبح","Move 13% faster and dash returns sooner.":"تحرك أسرع بنسبة 13% واستعد الاندفاع بسرعة أكبر.","Phoenix Core":"جوهر العنقاء","Restore 35 vitality and raise max vitality by 15.":"استعد 35 نقطة صحة وارفع الحد الأقصى للصحة بمقدار 15.","Rift Conduit":"موصل الشق","Rift Burst hits harder and recharges faster.":"يزداد ضرر انفجار الشق وتتسارع إعادة شحنه.","Long Eclipse":"الكسوف الطويل","Strike range +20% and wider blade arcs.":"‏+20% إلى مدى الضربات وأقواس نصل أوسع.","Aether Orbit":"مدار الأثير","Gain a revolving ember that damages nearby foes.":"اكسب جمرة تدور حولك وتؤذي الأعداء القريبين.","Blood of Dawn":"دم الفجر","Maximum vitality +30 and fully heal.":"‏+30 إلى الصحة القصوى واستعد صحتك بالكامل.","Storm Muscle":"عضلات العاصفة","Attack cooldown -15% and strike speed rises.":"قلّل وقت انتظار الهجوم بنسبة 15% وارفع سرعة الضربات.","OPEN · WAVE 01":"مفتوح · الموجة 01","DEFEAT THE RIFT TITAN · WAVE 05":"اهزم عملاق الشق · الموجة 05","DEFEAT THE THORN TITAN · WAVE 10":"اهزم عملاق الأشواك · الموجة 10","UNSEALED · START AT WAVE 06":"فُتح · ابدأ من الموجة 06","UNSEALED · START AT WAVE 11":"فُتح · ابدأ من الموجة 11","CHOOSE REALM":"اختر العالم","REALM":"العالم","START AT WAVE":"ابدأ من الموجة","SELECTED":"المحدد","STYLE":"الأسلوب","PERSONAL RECORD":"أفضل سجل","SOUND ENABLED":"تم تشغيل الصوت","SOUND MUTED":"تم كتم الصوت","AUDIO ENABLED":"تم تشغيل الصوت","AUDIO MUTED":"تم كتم الصوت","DODGE":"تفادَ","FROST":"صقيع","ROOT WARNING":"تحذير الجذور","BRAMBLE":"أشواك","ENRAGED":"في حالة هياج","THE RIFT REWARDS THE STRONG":"الشق يكافئ الأقوياء","REALM TRIAL":"اختبار العالم","Daily contract claimed:":"تم استلام العقد اليومي:","DAILY CONTRACTS · TODAY":"العقود اليومية · اليوم","FOUR WEAPON STYLES":"أربعة أنماط للأسلحة","POWER":"القوة","SPEED":"السرعة","REACH":"المدى"});
Object.assign(I18N.tr,{'Piercing thrusts strike through a line of foes; later targets take reduced damage.':'Delici saplamalar düşman sırasını deler; sonraki hedefler daha az hasar alır.',"INTERFACE LANGUAGE":"ARAYÜZ DİLİ","Balanced cuts for every situation.":"Her duruma uygun dengeli darbeler.","Fast dual strikes and agile movement.":"Hızlı çift darbeler ve çevik hareket.","Heavy broad hits that knock back lighter foes.":"Hafif düşmanları geri savuran ağır ve geniş darbeler.","Long, narrow thrusts reward careful aim.":"Uzun ve dar saplamalar dikkatli nişan almayı ödüllendirir.","ASHEN VERGE":"KÜL SINIRI","THE BROKEN BORDER":"KIRIK SINIR","The Eclipse first split the sky here. Black glass and fallen embers mark the place where the old light died.":"Tutulma göğü ilk kez burada yardı. Siyah cam ve düşen közler, eski ışığın söndüğü yeri işaretler.","REALM TRIAL · Survive the first five waves and defeat the Rift Titan.":"DİYAR SINAVI · İlk beş dalgadan sağ çık ve Yarık Titanı yen.","OBJECTIVE · SURVIVE THE ASHEN VERGE":"HEDEF · KÜL SINIRINDA HAYATTA KAL","ASHEN VERGE · THE ECLIPSE BEGINS":"KÜL SINIRI · TUTULMA BAŞLIYOR","RIFT TITAN":"YARIK TİTANI","GLOAMWOOD":"ALACAKARANLIK ORMANI","THE LIVING DUSK":"YAŞAYAN ALACAKARANLIK","A forest swallowed by twilight. Its roots remember every warrior lost beneath the canopy and lash out at anyone who stands still.":"Alacakaranlığın yuttuğu bir orman. Kökleri, dallarının altında kaybolan her savaşçıyı hatırlar ve hareketsiz kalanlara saldırır.","REALM TRIAL · Bramble blooms mark the ground before striking. Keep moving.":"DİYAR SINAVI · Dikenler saldırmadan önce zemini işaretler. Hareket etmeye devam et.","OBJECTIVE · BREAK THE BRAMBLE CURSE":"HEDEF · DİKEN LANETİNİ KIR","GLOAMWOOD UNSEALED · WATCH THE ROOTS":"ALACAKARANLIK ORMANI AÇILDI · KÖKLERE DİKKAT ET","THORN TITAN":"DİKEN TİTANI","FROSTVEIN CITADEL":"BUZDAMAR KALESİ","THE SILENT CROWN":"SESSİZ TAÇ","An abandoned citadel locked in a storm without end. The ice records each step, then punishes anyone who cannot escape its falling shards.":"Bitmeyen bir fırtınaya hapsolmuş terk edilmiş bir kale. Buz her adımı kaydeder ve düşen parçalarından kaçamayanları cezalandırır.","REALM TRIAL · Frostfall zones deal heavy damage and slow you briefly.":"DİYAR SINAVI · Buz düşüşü bölgeleri ağır hasar verir ve seni kısa süre yavaşlatır.","OBJECTIVE · ENDURE THE FROSTFALL":"HEDEF · BUZ FIRTINASINA DAYAN","FROSTVEIN CITADEL · THE COLD IS HUNTING YOU":"BUZDAMAR KALESİ · SOĞUK SENİ AVLAMAYA GELİYOR","FROST TITAN":"BUZ TİTANI","Vitality Matrix":"Canlılık Matrisi","+15 maximum HP per rank. Start each run at full vitality.":"Her rütbede maksimum cana +15. Her tura tam canla başla.","Rune of Ruin":"Yıkım Rünü","+8% base weapon damage per rank. Stacks with run upgrades.":"Her rütbede temel silah hasarına +%8. Tur geliştirmeleriyle birikir.","Phase Cell":"Faz Hücresi","Dash recovers 8% faster per rank, up to four ranks.":"Her rütbede atılma %8 daha hızlı yenilenir; en fazla dört rütbe.","Rift Capacitor":"Yarık Kondansatörü","+10% Rift Burst damage per rank.":"Her rütbede Yarık Patlaması hasarına +%10.","Soul Magnet":"Ruh Mıknatısı","Essence orbs begin pulling toward you from farther away.":"Öz küreleri daha uzaktan sana doğru çekilmeye başlar.","Choose a permanent upgrade. It will take effect next run.":"Kalıcı bir geliştirme seç. Sonraki turda etkinleşecek.","This upgrade has reached its maximum rank.":"Bu geliştirme en yüksek rütbeye ulaştı.","Not enough shards. Defeat more Riftborn to earn":"Yeterli parça yok. Kazanmak için daha fazla Yarıkdoğumlu yen:","additional shards.":"ek parça.","Defeat enemies for 5–8 shards each. Titans award 45 shards. Every kill is saved to your local wallet.":"Her düşman için 5–8 parça kazan. Titanlar 45 parça verir. Her yenilgi yerel cüzdanına kaydedilir.","Browser storage is unavailable; purchases may not persist after closing the page.":"Tarayıcı depolaması kullanılamıyor; satın alımlar sayfa kapanınca korunmayabilir.","PURCHASE COMPLETE":"SATIN ALMA TAMAMLANDI","is now rank":"artık şu rütbede","Active next run.":"Sonraki turda etkin.","Storage is unavailable, so it may not survive closing the page.":"Depolama kullanılamıyor; sayfa kapanınca kayıt korunmayabilir.","MAX RANK":"MAKSİMUM RÜTBE","BUY UPGRADE":"GELİŞTİRME SATIN AL","NEED":"GEREKLİ","MORE":"DAHA","RANK":"RÜTBE","PERMANENT RANK":"KALICI RÜTBE","DAILY":"GÜNLÜK","PROGRESS":"İLERLEME","REWARD CLAIMED":"ÖDÜL ALINDI","CLAIM":"AL","IN PROGRESS":"DEVAM EDİYOR","LOCKED":"KİLİTLİ","EQUIPPED":"KUŞANILDI","UNLOCKED":"AÇILDI","Always available":"Her zaman kullanılabilir","Defeat 50 Riftborn":"50 Yarıkdoğumlu yen","Defeat your first Titan":"İlk Titanını yen","Unseal Gloamwood":"Alacakaranlık Ormanı’nı aç","Unseal Frostvein Citadel":"Buzdamar Kalesi’ni aç","Start a run with all 4 weapons":"Dört silahın tamamıyla bir tur başlat","Rift Spark":"Yarık Kıvılcımı","Ember Trail":"Köz İzi","Titanbreaker":"Titan Kıran","Gloam Warden":"Alacakaranlık Muhafızı","Frost Crown":"Buz Tacı","Prism Walker":"Prizma Gezgini","FIRST SPARK":"İLK KIVILCIM","Defeat your first Riftborn.":"İlk Yarıkdoğumlunu yen.","INITIATION":"BAŞLANGIÇ","SOUL HARVESTER":"RUH HASATÇISI","Defeat 100 enemies across all runs.":"Tüm turlarda toplam 100 düşman yen.","HUNTER":"AVCI","TITAN BREAKER":"TİTAN KIRAN","Defeat your first realm Titan.":"İlk diyar Titanını yen.","BOSS SLAYER":"PATRON AVCISI","TITAN TRIO":"TİTAN ÜÇLÜSÜ","Defeat three Titans in total.":"Toplam üç Titan yen.","VETERAN":"KIDEMLİ","STORM SURVIVOR":"FIRTINA HAYATTA KALANI","Reach wave 10 in your campaign record.":"Sefer kaydında 10. dalgaya ulaş.","SURVIVAL":"HAYATTA KALMA","REALMWALKER":"DİYAR GEZGİNİ","Unseal the second realm.":"İkinci diyarı aç.","EXPLORER":"KAŞİF","FROSTBOUND":"BUZA BAĞLI","Unseal all three realms.":"Üç diyarın tamamını aç.","CAMPAIGN":"SEFER","THE ARSENAL":"CEPHANELİK","Start a run with each of the four weapons.":"Dört silahın her biriyle bir tur başlat.","MASTERY":"USTALIK","RIFTSWEEPER":"YARIK TEMİZLEY