// v2.6.3 locale and backup hotfix: complete static HUD/help strings and preserve campaign selection in backups.
Object.assign(I18N.ar,{'Piercing thrusts strike through a line of foes; later targets take reduced damage.':'طعنات نافذة تخترق صف الأعداء، ويقل الضرر على الأهداف اللاحقة.',"EMBERFALL: Rift Arena — v2.8.0 Locale & Dynamic Text Fix":"EMBERFALL: ساحة الصدع — الإصدار 2.7.1 · ديناميكية الاصطدام","12-CHAPTER ECLIPSE CAMPAIGN · TITAN PANTHEON":"حملة الكسوف من 12 فصلًا · سلالة العمالقة","60 waves · 12 chapter contracts · 3 realms · persistent campaign milestones. Complete each chapter contract by defeating enough enemies and its Titan to earn bonus shards.":"60 موجة · 12 عقدًا للفصول · 3 عوالم · تقدم دائم للحملة. أكمل عقد كل فصل بهزيمة عدد كافٍ من الأعداء وعملاق الفصل لتحصل على شظايا إضافية.","Survive the Rift, build a stronger fighter with each level, and defeat the Titan at every fifth wave. Move with the left stick, tap to aim, strike to attack, and dash through warning rings to charge your Rift Echo.":"انشقت السماء، وصار ثمانية من العمالقة يحرسون الشق. أوقف هجمة عملاق بصدى شق مشحون بالكامل، ثم اهزمه لتحصل على نواة الكسوف. أنفق نواة واحدة على تمزق العدم لإزالة نصف الصحة المتبقية للعملاق.","Campaign objective":"هدف الحملة","CHAPTER I · ASHEN VERGE":"الفصل الأول · تخوم الرماد","BEST CAMPAIGN WAVE: 01 · CHAPTERS CLEARED: 0/12":"أفضل موجة في الحملة: 01 · الفصول المكتملة: 0/12","BEST RIFT CHAIN · 0":"أفضل سلسلة شق · 0","RIFT RELICS · 0 / 7":"آثار الشق · 0 / 7","ECLIPSE CORES · 0 · BREAK A TITAN CAST TO EARN":"نوى الكسوف · 0 · اكسر هجمة عملاق لتحصل عليها","PATH · CINDER DUELIST":"المسار · مبارز الجمر","RIFT ECHO · DASH NEAR MARKED DANGERS OR SKIM PROJECTILES TO CHARGE A COUNTER-BURST. BREAK A TITAN WINDUP WITH A FULLY CHARGED ECHO, THEN DEFEAT IT TO EARN 1 ECLIPSE CORE. PRESS U / CORE TO SPEND 1 CORE AND REMOVE 50% OF A TITAN'S CURRENT HEALTH.":"صدى الشق · اندفع قرب الأخطار المحددة أو مر بمحاذاة المقذوفات لشحن هجمة مضادة. اكسر استعداد العملاق لهجومه بصدى مشحون بالكامل، ثم اهزمه لتحصل على نواة كسوف واحدة. اضغط U أو زر النواة لإنفاق نواة وإزالة 50٪ من صحة العملاق الحالية.","CHOOSE LANGUAGE · DİL SEÇ · اختر اللغة":"اختر اللغة · CHOOSE LANGUAGE","♜ Eight Titan Types":"♜ ثمانية أنواع من العمالقة","⚔ Weapon Styles":"⚔ أنماط الأسلحة","☄ Rift Mutations":"☄ طفرات الشق","Distinct attacks and silhouettes":"هجمات وأشكال مميزة","Changing enemy rules every two waves":"تتغير قواعد الأعداء كل موجتين","REWARD ×2.65":"المكافأة ×2.65","REWARD ×4.5":"المكافأة ×4.5","SELECTED TRIAL · STANDARD · SHARD MULTIPLIER ×1.0":"التحدي المختار · عادي · مضاعف الشظايا ×1.0","TRIAL · STANDARD · ×1.0":"التحدي · عادي · ×1.0","TRIAL: STANDARD":"التحدي: عادي","SHARDS EARNED: 0":"الشظايا المكتسبة: 0","RELICS CLAIMED · 0":"الآثار المحصّلة · 0","COMBAT PATH · CINDER DUELIST":"مسار القتال · مبارز الجمر","Elites defeated":"النخبة المهزومة","⚙ GAME SETTINGS":"⚙ إعدادات اللعبة","◈ RIFT BAZAAR":"◈ سوق الشق","◈ VISIT RIFT BAZAAR":"◈ زيارة سوق الشق","◈ RIFT BAZAAR ·":"◈ سوق الشق ·","✧ LEGACY & CONTRACTS":"✧ السجل والعقود","✧ LEGACY & DAILY CONTRACTS ·":"✧ السجل والعقود اليومية ·","THE SHATTERED WORLD · CAMPAIGN MAP":"العالم المحطّم · خريطة الحملة","HOW TO EARN SHARDS":"كيفية كسب الشظايا","TODAY":"اليوم","BALANCED":"متوازن","Language / Dil / اللغة":"اللغة","Pause":"إيقاف مؤقت","Void Rupture":"تمزق العدم","Rift Trials":"تحديات الشق","Combat doctrine":"مدرسة القتال","Visual quality":"جودة الرسوم","Master volume":"مستوى الصوت الرئيسي","Emberfall game arena":"ساحة لعبة Emberfall","Spend 1 Eclipse Core to remove half a Titan's current health":"أنفق نواة كسوف لإزالة نصف صحة العملاق الحالية"});
Object.assign(I18N.tr,{'Piercing thrusts strike through a line of foes; later targets take reduced damage.':'Delici saplamalar düşman sırasını deler; sonraki hedefler daha az hasar alır.',"EMBERFALL: Rift Arena — v2.8.0 Locale & Dynamic Text Fix":"EMBERFALL: Yarık Arenası — Sürüm 2.7.1 · Darbe Dinamikleri","12-CHAPTER ECLIPSE CAMPAIGN · TITAN PANTHEON":"12 Bölümlük Tutulma Seferi · Titanlar Panteonu","60 waves · 12 chapter contracts · 3 realms · persistent campaign milestones. Complete each chapter contract by defeating enough enemies and its Titan to earn bonus shards.":"60 dalga · 12 bölüm görevi · 3 diyar · kalıcı sefer ilerlemesi. Ek yarık parçaları kazanmak için yeterince düşman ve bölümün Titanını yenerek her bölüm görevini tamamla.","Survive the Rift, build a stronger fighter with each level, and defeat the Titan at every fifth wave. Move with the left stick, tap to aim, strike to attack, and dash through warning rings to charge your Rift Echo.":"Gökyüzü yarıldı; artık sekiz Titan türü Yarığı koruyor. Tam dolu Yarık Yankısı ile bir Titanın saldırı hazırlığını boz, onu yen ve bir Tutulma Çekirdeği kazan. Titanın kalan canının yarısını silmek için bir Çekirdeği Hiçlik Yarılması üzerinde harca.","Campaign objective":"Sefer hedefi","CHAPTER I · ASHEN VERGE":"BÖLÜM I · KÜL SINIRI","BEST CAMPAIGN WAVE: 01 · CHAPTERS CLEARED: 0/12":"EN İYİ SEFER DALGASI: 01 · TAMAMLANAN BÖLÜMLER: 0/12","BEST RIFT CHAIN · 0":"EN İYİ YARIK ZİNCİRİ · 0","RIFT RELICS · 0 / 7":"YARIK KALINTILARI · 0 / 7","ECLIPSE CORES · 0 · BREAK A TITAN CAST TO EARN":"TUTULMA ÇEKİRDEKLERİ · 0 · KAZANMAK İÇİN TİTAN SALDIRISINI BOZ","PATH · CINDER DUELIST":"YOL · KOR DÜELLOCUSU","RIFT ECHO · DASH NEAR MARKED DANGERS OR SKIM PROJECTILES TO CHARGE A COUNTER-BURST. BREAK A TITAN WINDUP WITH A FULLY CHARGED ECHO, THEN DEFEAT IT TO EARN 1 ECLIPSE CORE. PRESS U / CORE TO SPEND 1 CORE AND REMOVE 50% OF A TITAN'S CURRENT HEALTH.":"YARIK YANKISI · Karşı patlamayı şarj etmek için işaretli tehlikelerin yakınına atıl veya mermilerin yanından sıyrıl. 1 Tutulma Çekirdeği kazanmak için tam dolu Yankı ile Titanın saldırı hazırlığını boz ve ardından onu yen. 1 Çekirdek harcayıp Titanın mevcut canının %50’sini silmek için U / ÇEKİRDEK tuşuna bas.","CHOOSE LANGUAGE · DİL SEÇ · اختر اللغة":"DİL SEÇ · اختر اللغة","♜ Eight Titan Types":"♜ Sekiz Titan Türü","⚔ Weapon Styles":"⚔ Silah Tarzları","☄ Rift Mutations":"☄ Yarık Mutasyonları","Distinct attacks and silhouettes":"Farklı saldırılar ve silüetler","Changing enemy rules every two waves":"Düşman kuralları her iki dalgada değişir","REWARD ×2.65":"ÖDÜL ×2,65","REWARD ×4.5":"ÖDÜL ×4,5","SELECTED TRIAL · STANDARD · SHARD MULTIPLIER ×1.0":"SEÇİLİ DENEME · STANDART · PARÇA ÇARPANI ×1,0","TRIAL · STANDARD · ×1.0":"DENEME · STANDART · ×1,0","TRIAL: STANDARD":"DENEME: STANDART","SHARDS EARNED: 0":"KAZANILAN PARÇALAR: 0","RELICS CLAIMED · 0":"ALINAN KALINTILAR · 0","COMBAT PATH · CINDER DUELIST":"SAVAŞ YOLU · KOR DÜELLOCUSU","Elites defeated":"Yenilen elitler","⚙ GAME SETTINGS":"⚙ OYUN AYARLARI","◈ RIFT BAZAAR":"◈ YARIK PAZARI","◈ VISIT RIFT BAZAAR":"◈ YARIK PAZARINI ZİYARET ET","◈ RIFT BAZAAR ·":"◈ YARIK PAZARI ·","✧ LEGACY & CONTRACTS":"✧ MİRAS VE GÖREVLER","✧ LEGACY & DAILY CONTRACTS ·":"✧ MİRAS VE GÜNLÜK GÖREVLER ·","THE SHATTERED WORLD · CAMPAIGN MAP":"PARÇALANMIŞ DÜNYA · SEFER HARİTASI","HOW TO EARN SHARDS":"PARÇALAR NASIL KAZANILIR","TODAY":"BUGÜN","BALANCED":"DENGELİ","Language / Dil / اللغة":"Dil","Pause":"Duraklat","Void Rupture":"Hiçlik Yarılması","Rift Trials":"Yarık Denemeleri","Combat doctrine":"Savaş öğretisi","Visual quality":"Görsel kalite","Master volume":"Ana ses düzeyi","Emberfall game arena":"Emberfall oyun arenası","Spend 1 Eclipse Core to remove half a Titan's current health":"Titanın mevcut canının yarısını silmek için 1 Tutulma Çekirdeği harca"});
Object.assign(I18N.ar,{'Piercing thrusts strike through a line of foes; later targets take reduced damage.':'طعنات نافذة تخترق صف الأعداء، ويقل الضرر على الأهداف اللاحقة.','CHALLENGE SETTINGS':'إعدادات التحدي','OPTIONAL · DIFFICULTY & REWARDS':'اختياري · الصعوبة والمكافآت','BUILD YOUR FIGHTER':'جهّز مقاتلك','OPTIONAL · WEAPON & DOCTRINE':'اختياري · السلاح وأسلوب القتال','HOW TO SURVIVE':'كيف تصمد','MOVE · LEFT STICK':'الحركة · العصا اليسرى','AIM · TAP THE ARENA':'التوجيه · المس ساحة اللعب','ATTACK · STRIKE':'الهجوم · ضربة','DODGE · DASH THROUGH WARNING RINGS':'تفادَ الخطر · اندفع عبر دوائر التحذير','Survive the Rift, build a stronger fighter with each level, and defeat the Titan at every fifth wave. Move with the left stick, tap to aim, strike to attack, and dash through warning rings to charge your Rift Echo.':'اصمد في الشق وطوّر مقاتلك مع كل مستوى واهزم العملاق كل خمس موجات. تحرك بالعصا اليسرى والمس للتوجيه واضرب للهجوم واندفع عبر دوائر التحذير لشحن صدى الشق.'});Object.assign(I18N.tr,{'Piercing thrusts strike through a line of foes; later targets take reduced damage.':'Delici saplamalar düşman sırasını deler; sonraki hedefler daha az hasar alır.','CHALLENGE SETTINGS':'Meydan Okuma Ayarları','OPTIONAL · DIFFICULTY & REWARDS':'İsteğe bağlı · Zorluk ve ödüller','BUILD YOUR FIGHTER':'Savaşçını Hazırla','OPTIONAL · WEAPON & DOCTRINE':'İsteğe bağlı · Silah ve tarz','HOW TO SURVIVE':'Hayatta Kalma Rehberi','MOVE · LEFT STICK':'Hareket · Sol çubuk','AIM · TAP THE ARENA':'Nişan · Arenaya dokun','ATTACK · STRIKE':'Saldırı · Vuruş','DODGE · DASH THROUGH WARNING RINGS':'Kaçın · Uyarı halkalarından atıl','Survive the Rift, build a stronger fighter with each level, and defeat the Titan at every fifth wave. Move with the left stick, tap to aim, strike to attack, and dash through warning rings to charge your Rift Echo.':'Yarıkta hayatta kal, her seviyede savaşçını güçlendir ve her beş dalgada bir Titanı yen. Sol çubukla hareket et, nişan almak için arenaya dokun, saldır ve Yarık Yankısını doldurmak için uyarı halkalarının içinden atıl.'});
